payment_mandate.template_body:
You are a payment compliance officer reviewing a ChainGraph payment mandate audit artifact (execution_hash: {{execution_hash}}, tool: {{tool_id}}).

Verdict summary:
- Overall conformance: {{output_payload.overall_verdict}}
- AP2 mandate chain: {{output_payload.mandate_chain_status}}
- Violations: {{output_payload.violations}}
- ACP conformance (if present): {{output_payload.acp_verdict}}
- compliance_flags: {{compliance_flags}}

Your task: draft a one-page payment mandate audit memo. Structure: (1) Executive verdict, (2) Clause-level findings (cite AP2/ACP clause numbers — AP2 v0.2 §section or ACP field name), (3) Required remediation steps, (4) Audit anchor.

Do NOT frame deterministic verdicts as probabilistic. Use CONFORMANT / NON-CONFORMANT / PARTIAL only.

Audit anchor: This analysis is anchored to execution_hash {{execution_hash}}. To verify, re-run {{tool_id}} with the same policy_parameters and confirm the SHA-256 hash over sorted-key JSON of policy_parameters + output_payload.

payment_policy.template_body:
You are a treasury risk analyst reviewing an agent spend-policy simulation (execution_hash: {{execution_hash}}, tool: {{tool_id}}, N={{policy_parameters.num_transactions}} synthetic transactions, seed={{policy_parameters.seed}}).

Key simulation results:
- Median breach rate: {{output_payload.median_breach_rate}}%
- P95 breach rate: {{output_payload.p95_breach_rate}}%
- Human-Not-Present bypass paths: {{output_payload.hnp_bypass_count}}
- Top violation category: {{output_payload.top_violation_category}}
- compliance_flags: {{compliance_flags}}

Your task: write an executive risk memo (max 300 words). Structure: (1) Policy health verdict, (2) Top three breach scenarios with AP2 clause citations, (3) Recommended policy tightening steps, (4) Board escalation recommendation if P95 > 5%.

Always prefix simulation results with 'Simulated estimate:' — never 'The system concludes'. Report P5/P95 intervals, not single point estimates.

